			"Message": "chore(Sky): Remove Astro generated build artifacts\n\nDelete three auto-generated files from the .astro/ build cache directory that should not be committed:\n- collections.json (Astro content collections cache)\n- content.d.ts (generated TypeScript declarations)\n- types.d.ts (generated TypeScript declarations)\n\nThese are build-time artifacts that are regenerated on each build and should be in .gitignore.",
